[LEVEL]
start    = 27, 1        ; cell the player spawns in, 0-based x, y
angle    = 90           ; compass bearing: 0 north (up the grid), 90 east, 180 south, 270 west
end      = 23, 16       ; cell that ends the level
title    = Cold Storage
location = Hamburg, Germany
mappos   = 130, 44      ; pixel position on the world map screen

[BRIEFING]
A shipping company on the Hamburg docks has been moving more than freight.
Customs flagged a refrigerated warehouse that draws three times the power its
manifest justifies, and the night shift is armed. We believe the basement holds
a laboratory producing the nerve agent recovered in Vienna last month.

Get in through the service corridor, find the laboratory and secure the
research before it can be moved. The site manager's keycard opens the cold
store at the back of the building. Expect hired guards on the upper floor and
trained men below. Civilians work the day shift only, so anyone you meet
after dark is there for a reason.

[OBJECTIVE]
Locate the laboratory
Find the hidden lab in the basement below the cold store.

[OBJECTIVE]
Recover the research
Take the sample case and the production notes from the lab.

[OBJECTIVE]
Reach the cold store
Use the manager's keycard to get through the locked door at the back.
